# ⏰ Digital Clock (HTML, CSS, JS)

A responsive, animated digital clock with a glassmorphism design, live greeting, date display, 12h/24h toggle, and 4 switchable color themes.

## Files

- `index.html` — page structure
- `style.css` — styling, animations, layout
- `script.js` — clock logic and interactivity

## Run it

Just open `index.html` in any browser. No build tools needed.
